return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Rejalashtirilgan maqolalar chop etilishi uchun ushbu WordPress saytini Zinn Digital® ga ulaydi. Zinn® boshqaruv panelingizdan juftlashtirish kodini joylashtiring va plagin oʻzining hisob maʼlumotlarini oʻrnatadi — hech narsa qoʻlda nusxalanmaydi.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'Ushbu saytning PHP-si arxivlar yarata olmaydi, shuning uchun zaxira nusxasini yaratib bo\'lmadi.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Vaqtinchalik fayl yaratib bo\'lmadi.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Bu saytning fayllarini arxivlab bo\'lmadi.','The archive could not be read back.'=>'Arxivni qayta o‘qib bo‘lmadi.','The backup could not be uploaded.'=>'Zaxira nusxasini yuklab bo‘lmadi.','The backup upload was rejected.'=>'Zaxira nusxasini yuklash rad etildi.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Bu WordPress foydalanuvchisi postlarni chop eta olmaydi, shuning uchun hozir oʻrnatilgan ulanish ham ularni chop eta olmaydi. Postlarni chop eta oladigan foydalanuvchi sifatida kiring va qayta urinib koʻring.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ushbu saytda ilova parollari o‘chirilgan, shuning uchun ma’lumotlarni yaratib bo‘lmaydi. Ularni yoqishni xosting provayderingizdan so‘rang yoki saytni Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelida o‘zingiz yaratgan parol bilan ulang.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress ushbu sayt uchun ma’lumotnoma yarata olmadi. Hech qaerga hech narsa yuborilmadi.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Ushbu saytdan Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Hech narsa ulanmagan va biz yaratgan ma\'lumotlar o‘chirib tashlangan. Sayt chiquvchi so‘rovlarni yubora olishini tekshirib, qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® juftlash kodini qabul qilmadi. Hech narsa ulanmadi. Boshqaruv panelingizda yangi kod yarating va qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'Ulandi. Zinn Digital® endi ushbu saytga e\'lon qilishi mumkin.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qoʻllanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va birdan ortiq saytni boshqaradigan shaxslar uchun mo\'ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni sotib oling va soting, ikkala tomon ham mamnun bo\'lgunga qadar pul xavfsiz tarzda saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','This site is connected to Zinn Digital®, publishing as %s.'=>'Bu sayt %s sifatida chop etuvchi Zinn Digital® bilan ulangan.','To disconnect, revoke the “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password on %s.'=>'Uzib qo‘yish uchun %s da “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” ilova parolini bekor qiling.','your profile'=>'sizning profilingiz','Connect this site'=>'Ushbu saytni ulash','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelingizni oching, Kontent → Boshqa saytlar bo‘limiga o‘ting va “Juftlash kodini olish” tugmasini bosing. Uni quyiga qo‘ying.','Pairing code'=>'Juftlash kodi','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'U uni yaratganingizdan keyin o‘ttiz daqiqa o‘tib o‘z kuchini yo‘qotadi va faqat bir marta ishlatilishi mumkin.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Ushbu saytni ulashga ruxsat berilmagan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalarini ko\'ring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'tmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.']];